---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'August 14, 2026';
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — LA Activity Club"
  description="How LA Activity Club collects, uses, and protects your information."
>
  <Header />

  <section class="page-hero" style="height:32vh; min-height:220px;">
    <div class="photo">
      <img
        src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Wide_View_of_Sedona_Red_Rock_Country.jpg?width=1600"
        alt="Sedona red rock country"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="page-hero-content">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy Policy</div>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-page">
    <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <p>
      LA Activity Club ("LAC," "we," "us") is operated by Next Generation Wellness LLC. This
      policy explains what information we collect when you use laactivityclub.com or sign up
      for a hike, retreat, or our mailing list, how we use it, and who we share it with.
    </p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>Depending on how you interact with the site, we may collect:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Contact information:</strong> full name, email address, phone number.</li>
      <li><strong>Location information:</strong> city and ZIP code, if you join our mailing list.</li>
      <li><strong>Accommodation information:</strong> gender, collected specifically for retreat bookings to plan shared villa rooming.</li>
      <li><strong>Booking details:</strong> which retreat you're booking, number of spots, and any notes you provide (e.g. dietary needs).</li>
      <li><strong>Payment information:</strong> we never see or store your full card details. Payments are processed entirely by Stripe, our payment processor; we receive confirmation that payment succeeded and the amount, not your card number.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use your information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To process and confirm retreat bookings, including accommodation planning.</li>
      <li>To send hike updates, retreat announcements, and related communications if you've signed up for our list.</li>
      <li>To respond to questions submitted through our contact form.</li>
      <li>To improve and operate the website.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>

    <h2>Who we share information with</h2>
    <p>We use a small number of trusted service providers to operate the site:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Stripe</strong> &mdash; processes retreat payments. See Stripe's own privacy policy for how they handle payment data.</li>
      <li><strong>Resend</strong> &mdash; delivers our email notifications.</li>
      <li>Our hosting provider (Vercel) and database provider, which store the information described above on our behalf.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We don't use third-party advertising or tracking cookies on this site.</p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>
      We keep booking and signup information for as long as reasonably needed to operate LAC
      (including for accounting and legal purposes) or until you ask us to delete it.
    </p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      You can ask us to access, correct, or delete the personal information we hold about you,
      or unsubscribe from our mailing list at any time, by emailing
      <a href="mailto:team@laactivityclub.com">team@laactivityclub.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>Our services are not directed to children, and we do not knowingly collect information from anyone under 13.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time; the "Last updated" date above will reflect the most recent change.</p>

    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:team@laactivityclub.com">team@laactivityclub.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
